    "title": "\"This entire trip was an awesome show of leadership … - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By HoopsHype ,\n21 hours ago\nJovan Buha: \"This entire trip was an awesome show of leadership from Luka Doncic to organize the trip, to fly the guys out there, and to have a variety of team-bonding activities. They played basketball, but they also golfed, they went rowing, they were racing bikes down the street, they were checking out castles. It is one thing to say you are going to step up as a leader or to go into the season hoping to step up as a leader, hoping to replace the void of losing LeBron James and Jarred Vanderbilt from a vocal leadership perspective, but Luka actually took action here, and that is commendable.\"\nYouTube\nThis article originally appeared on Hoops Hype: \"This entire trip was an awesome show of leadership …",
